    "chunk_text": "hy \u00feor hata\u00f0, Mercuries And sum wif hatte Uenus seo w\u00e6s Ioues dohtor, & seo w\u00e6s swa ful & swa fracod on galnysse \u00fe\u00e6t hyre Manege eac o\u00f0re h\u00e6\u00feene godas w\u00e6ron mistlice fundene & eac swylce h\u00e6\u00feene gydena on swy\u00f0licum And se syrwienda deofol \u00fee a swica\u00f0 embe mancyn gebrohte \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan men on \u00feam healicon Ac se bi\u00f0 ges\u00e6lig \u00fee eal swylc oferhoga\u00f0 & \u00f0one so\u00f0an Godd lufa\u00f0 & weor\u00f0a\u00f0 \u00fee ealle \u00feing gescop & An is \u00e6lmihtig God on \u00ferym hadum, \u00fe\u00e6t is f\u00e6der & suna & halig gast. Ealle \u00fea \u00f0ry naman befeh\u00f0 an godcund miht & is an ece God, waldend & wyrhta ealra gesceafta. Him symle sy lof & weor\u00f0mynt in ealra worulda woruld a butan ende, amen..",
